Build.Settings.cache_slots

What this means:
  Build.Settings.cache_slots = 4
  [shadowed] declaration / package 1 at package.jet:settings.cache_slots (default):0..0
  [effective] environment / function 4 at build_contribution_demo::build:127..137 reason=computed by fn build

Why Jet enforces it:
  the nearest source writer wins within the most explicit contribution layer; same-layer disagreement is an error

How to fix it:
  change the effective writer, or remove it to inherit the next writer in the chain

This explanation comes from jet's diagnostics reference.
